# J.S. Bach -- Prelude in C, BWV 846 (WTC I), bars 1-4. Public domain.
#
# Broken chords put every note of the harmony in a different instant, so the
# reconstruction never gets to hide inside a sustained cluster. Each bar is
# the same eight-note figure played twice.

